opennyai_summary.arguments:
5. Being aggrieved of the abovesaid order, the complainant has assailed the same on inter-alia following grounds:-
(i) That the impugned order dated 30.03.2021 is based on conjectures, surmises and passed without application of judicial mind;
(ii) That Ld. Trial Court misread the agreement to sell Ex. CW 1/A and failed to appreciate that substantial consideration amount had already been paid by the complainant to the accused;
(iii) That Ld. Trial Court failed to appreciate that the accused intended to cheat the complainant from very beginning and deliberately delayed the AKASH Digitally signed by AKASH JAIN JAIN
It was further argued that this revision petition is abuse of process of law and the impugned order dated 30.03.2021 is just, reasonable and does not suffer from any legal infirmity.
